{
  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The answer reports an adjusted difference (standardised for severity) rather than the simple overall difference in proportions requested (treatment minus control). This changes the estimand.",
    "Grounding: The cited overall severity distribution proportions (mild=0.5478, moderate=0.2893, severe=0.1629) are not shown in the printed output, so the numbers are not directly supported.",
    "Overreach: The answer claims to estimate a causal treatment effect, but the data are non‑randomised and only severity was adjusted for; causal inference is not justified."
  ]
}
